bench-hashes b3sum: how long b3sum takes to hash files, from its start to its exit

machine:   AMD Ryzen Threadripper PRO 7965WX 24-Cores, 48 CPUs, linux7.0.0-38-generic
files on:  ext4 (/dev/md0 on /)
